### Books - User endpoints
### Rode cada request clicando no ▶ ao lado de "###" (Android Studio / IntelliJ).

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Listar todos os usuários
GET {{host}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Buscar usuário por id
GET {{host}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### Buscar usuário inexistente (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/users/9999
Accept: application/json

### Criar usuário (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nathalia",
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "token": "tok-123",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Criar outro usuário
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fulano",
  "email": "fulano@poatek.com",
  "token": "tok-999",
  "password": "fulano456"
}

### Tentar criar usuário duplicado (409 Conflict — mesmo email/token)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outra",
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "token": "tok-123",
  "password": "qualquer"
}

### Editar usuário (200 — atualiza nome/email; senha opcional)
PUT {{host}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nathalia Santos",
  "email": "nathalia.santos@poatek.com",
  "password": "novasenha123"
}

### Deletar usuário (204 — soft delete, marca deleted=true)
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/1

### Restaurar usuário deletado (200 — deleted=false)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/restore

### Bloquear usuário (200 — blocked=true)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/block

### Desbloquear usuário (200 — blocked=false)
POST {{host}}/api/users/1/unblock

### Login com sucesso (200 — retorna o token)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Cadastro inválido (400 — email inválido + senha curta + name vazio)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "nao-eh-email",
  "token": "tok-xyz",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login com senha errada (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "password": "errada"
}

### Login de usuário bloqueado (403 Forbidden — rode após /block)
POST {{host}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nathalia@poatek.com",
  "password": "senha123"
}
